  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></math> be a differentiable function for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> equals :",
    "image": null
  },
